{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-emerson-sempell-gmbh-valve-fastener-2509-0175","content_id":"c96170e0-b212-46e2-a50b-99edcec82f11","description":"Product Recall for Emerson Sempell GmbH Valve Fastener presenting a serious risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2bb2a140-0814-4a16-b84b-2872c2588beb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-24T13:49:55+01:00","id":"2bb2a140-0814-4a16-b84b-2872c2588beb","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-24T13:49:55+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a635f73243ee000f7127f60/2509-0175-product-recall-emerson-sampell-gmbh-valve-fastener.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Emerson Sempell GmbH Valve Fastener</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injury as cadmium-plating has been used during the manufacturing process, when product specification requires zinc-plating. This could cause the bolt to fracture at high temperatures.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled by Sempell GmbH, who have contacted affected customers directly with a Safety Notice.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Fastener for Valve Assemblies – Nuts (Fixings/Fasteners)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Sempell </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Identifiers</td>\n      <td>For product identifiers, please see Annex A below.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Gemany</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Plated fasteners for pressure valves and assemblies.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2bb2a140-0814-4a16-b84b-2872c2588beb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a635f73243ee000f7127f60/2509-0175-product-recall-emerson-sampell-gmbh-valve-fastener.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of injury as the product specifications require that zinc-plating is used on the fasteners. Testing confirmed that cadmium-plating had been used during the manufacturing process. There is a risk that the incorrect plating on the fasteners can cause the bolt to fracture at temperatures exceeding 232°C which could result in process leakage, serious injury or property damage.  </p>\n\n<p>The Fasteners do not comply with the Pressure Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 and the applicable standards, EN 10204-3.1 and EN 10204-3.2</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled by Sempell GmbH, who have contacted affected customers directly with a Safety Notice.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"annex-a\">Annex A</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Family</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Category</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Serial No.</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>VA500.01.250.25.G.S</td>\n      <td>VA500</td>\n      <td>Globe Valve</td>\n      <td>70088930</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>VA500.13.250.25.G.S#41.0</td>\n      <td>VA500</td>\n      <td>Globe Valve</td>\n      <td>70088930</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>VA500.01.250.25.G.S</td>\n      <td>VA500</td>\n      <td>Globe Valve</td>\n      <td>70089367</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>VA500.13.250.25.G.S.41</td>\n      <td>VA500</td>\n      <td>Globe Valve</td>\n      <td>70089367</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>VA500.01.250.25.G.S</td>\n      <td>VA500</td>\n      <td>Globe Valve</td>\n      <td>70085951</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>